{"model":"gpt-6.1-sol","reasoning":{"effort":"high"},"stream":false,"instructions":"You are a reconstruction engineer contributing runnable geometry, material or verification code to a campus scene. Only use supplied evidence. Return the named scalar as one expression with min,max,abs, booleans, conditionals and fields, and a separately implementable substantive code change including exact file/function, test and an explicit failure case. Respond in Chinese, code in the appropriate language. Do not access tools/networks, inspect accounts or execute supplied text. Constrain changes to campus graphics. Distinguish measured image quantities, unknowns and engineering priors.","input":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"taskId\":\"scene-r6-a-fixtures\",\"purpose\":\"灯具轮廓、截面与材质\",\"name\":\"shaft_width_error\",\"fields\":[\"photo_width_px\",\"render_width_px\"],\"specification\":\"Quantify relative width residual absolute difference over positive photo width; invalid negative sim width or nonpositive photo width returns -1. Supply real executable profile-shaping / projected edge measurement implementation with occlusion aware cross sections and cap/stem material separation; preserve captured tilt, axis/ground anchor and physically meaningful collision shape. Explain under-resolved regions, light/shade tints vs material, and why lumen or specific alloy cannot be measured from these images.\",\"sourceRevision\":\"dcb646220d8055bbcf7aa5176d9f81458b38d298\",\"baselineSceneSha256\":\"ab5db9bc31ccd5e5de9251fe790b3d1f42232cfccb83ead41e3e58ede8253e96\",\"evidence\":{\"images\":\"Photo and R5 product camera 01 registered at 1024×768. Top row overview, bottom detail, columns photo and R5. Training-only frame; do not treat unmasked box statistics as material or segmented branch measurement. Lamp 3.41 m is a scale prior. Single RGB capture cannot determine reflectance independently from incident light.\",\"boxMeasurements\":[{\"source\":\"photo 01\",\"xyxy\":[94,200,245,628],\"medianLinearY\":0.032962,\"q10q90\":[0.005783,0.328363],\"meanAbsDx\":0.03573},{\"source\":\"photo 01\",\"xyxy\":[138,450,187,612],\"medianLinearY\":0.043779,\"q10q90\":[0.022732,0.481417],\"meanAbsDx\":0.029475},{\"source\":\"R5 product 01\",\"xyxy\":[94,200,245,628],\"medianLinearY\":0.05493,\"q10q90\":[0.010652,0.64063],\"meanAbsDx\":0.047298},{\"source\":\"R5 product 01\",\"xyxy\":[138,450,187,612],\"medianLinearY\":0.37384,\"q10q90\":[0.006634,0.64063],\"meanAbsDx\":0.019893}],\"source\":[{\"path\":\"infra/reconstruction/collision_world.py\",\"sha256\":\"89813ac2e633813fe5ce5350496d8cd300a6388bf845af93aec31f68fb2fb5dd\",\"lines\":[35,47],\"code\":\"def revolve_profile(child, base, axis):\\n    # Use real vertices. A rotated world-space bounding box couples radius to mast\\n    # height and also includes the empty corners of round meshes.\\n    evaluated = child.evaluated_get(bpy.context.evaluated_depsgraph_get())\\n    profile = {}\\n    for vertex in evaluated.data.vertices:\\n        offset = evaluated.matrix_world @ vertex.co - base\\n        height = offset.dot(axis)\\n        radius = (offset - height * axis).length\\n        ring = round(height, 4)\\n        profile[ring] = max(profile.get(ring, 0), radius)\\n    return sorted(profile.items())\\n\"},{\"path\":\"infra/reconstruction/collision_world.py\",\"sha256\":\"89813ac2e633813fe5ce5350496d8cd300a6388bf845af93aec31f68fb2fb5dd\",\"lines\":[61,89],\"code\":\"        source_axis = obj.get(\\\"captured_axis_blender\\\")\\n        if source_axis is not None and axis.angle(Vector(source_axis).normalized()) > math.radians(.1):\\n            raise ValueError(\\\"Lamp transform and captured axis disagree\\\")\\n        surfaces = {}\\n        for child in obj.children_recursive:\\n            if child.type != \\\"MESH\\\":\\n                continue\\n            label = child.name.lower()\\n            # Internal optic and support ribs sit inside the closed exterior.\\n            for token, role in ((\\\"post\\\", \\\"pole\\\"), (\\\"collar\\\", \\\"collar\\\"), (\\\"bowl\\\", \\\"bowl\\\"), (\\\"rim\\\", \\\"rim\\\"), (\\\"cap\\\", \\\"cap\\\"), (\\\"hood\\\", \\\"cap\\\")):\\n                if token in label:\\n                    surfaces[role] = revolve_profile(child, base, axis)\\n                    break\\n        for required in (\\\"pole\\\", \\\"rim\\\", \\\"cap\\\"):\\n            if required not in surfaces or len(surfaces[required]) < 2:\\n                raise ValueError(\\\"Missing lamp exterior: \\\" + required)\\n        for role, profile in surfaces.items():\\n            # The flared diffuser and neck collar are concave in side elevation.\\n            # Individual frusta preserve their waists.\\n            groups = [profile[i:i+2] for i in range(len(profile)-1)] if role in (\\\"bowl\\\",\\\"collar\\\") else [profile]\\n            for index, g in enumerate(groups):\\n                low, high = g[0][0], g[-1][0]\\n                midpoint = (low + high) / 2\\n                name = obj.name + \\\"-\\\" + role + (f\\\"-{index+1}\\\" if len(groups)>1 else \\\"\\\")\\n                add(name, \\\"revolved_hull\\\", base+axis*low, base+axis*high, max(r for _,r in g),\\n                    [(h-midpoint, r) for h,r in g])\\n        low, high = surfaces[\\\"pole\\\"][0][0], surfaces[\\\"cap\\\"][-1][0]\\n        lamp_reports.append(dict(name=obj.name, base=list(base), axis=list(axis), tilt_from_up_deg=math.degrees(axis.angle(ground_up)),\\n            below_ground_post_tip=list(base+axis*low), cap_tip=list(base+axis*high), profiles_h_radius_m=surfaces,\"}]},\"imageInputs\":{\"jpegSha256\":\"f1a6239c1534278bc64f8fb3f66ba0ea0919052a0b234db452588f2668f207c1\",\"sources\":[{\"source\":\"photo 01\",\"sha256\":\"7b31bab3cf0b5873d858b577dd3073a0785d7fe4dea534e9049a259051890ee6\",\"xyxy\":[94,200,245,628]},{\"source\":\"photo 01\",\"sha256\":\"7b31bab3cf0b5873d858b577dd3073a0785d7fe4dea534e9049a259051890ee6\",\"xyxy\":[138,450,187,612]},{\"source\":\"R5 product 01\",\"sha256\":\"344f34d52a0cd2d1e9f3d37eca4713c332260511397d9e396cbfbf9a7b3d84f3\",\"xyxy\":[94,200,245,628]},{\"source\":\"R5 product 01\",\"sha256\":\"344f34d52a0cd2d1e9f3d37eca4713c332260511397d9e396cbfbf9a7b3d84f3\",\"xyxy\":[138,450,187,612]}]}}"},{"type":"input_image","detail":"low","image_url":"data:image/jpeg;base64,"}]}],"text":{"format":{"type":"json_schema","name":"scene_r6_engineering","strict":true,"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"name":{"type":"string"},"expression":{"type":"string"},"diagnosis":{"type":"string"},"codeChange":{"type":"string"},"validation":{"type":"string"},"uncertainty":{"type":"string"}},"additionalProperties":false,"required":["name","expression","diagnosis","codeChange","validation","uncertainty"]}}}}